desc:
This elegant and beautiful upper level suite is located in a 100% smoke-free building and has the following features;

Three spacious bedrooms; 
Ample closet and pantry space;
Elegant Kitchen with beautiful counter space, new beautiful cabinets with built in lights and elegant wall tiling; 
Large, Full Bathroom with elegant wall tiling, and elegant mirror and a half bathroom in the master bedroom with elegant lights and a lovely vanity;
Very bright suite with lots of natural lighting, large windows, and large glass sliding doors;
Latest in European, Laminate Flooring throughout the suite; 
Elegant lighting; 
Large front and back balconies; 
Large fenced, backyard;
Beautiful landscaping maintained by Landlord;
Storage;
Two parking spaces on the property; 
Laundry;
No pets;
Centrally located on a quiet street,
Well maintained, safe neighborhood;
Near all amenities: groceries, schools, shopping malls, restaurants, cinemas, bus routes, recreational parks, fitness centers;

For ease of appointment scheduling, please feel free to leave a contact number or simply just email for a viewing. 

We look forward to hearing from you.

***Well-lit,clean and quiet half Basement;
***Two bedrooms, one bathroom, with living room and kitchen;
***Near Burnaby South High School/Skytrain/Metrotown Shopping Center/TNT supermarket/banks (can walk to there）；
**** This ad is for a basement suite rental, not a house. 
***Partially NEW renovated;
***Heating: hot water underfloor heating;
***Separate entrance/Onsite shared laundry room/Street parking just beside the house. 
**Condition: Sorry, no pet - no smoking, no subletting- no parties-no drugs;
